        "TileImage": "$($repository 4f388b6a-0fe0-4119-a9b3-1792922ce76e).Image",
        "Description": "Our client has requested to eliminate Salvatore Bravuomo, a lawyer who has dirt on Marco Abiatti who is running for mayor and is threatening their interests.\r\rLikewise, Ms Christina Dionisi, a lead singer of Cinque Ciliegie and one of Abiatti&apos;s connections to keep the public in favor of voting for him has rumored to have an affair with Bravuomo, jeapordizing his campaign secrets and upcoming elections.\r\rBoth targets will be present today with high security detail, so proceed with caution, 47.",
